==Russian==
[[Category:Russian nouns]]
===Etymology===
Old Church Slavonic [[вѣра]], from Indo-European ''*wēr-'' ‘true’.  Cognate with Ukrainian [[віра]], Bulgarian [[вяра]], Slovenian ''[[vera]]'', Polish ''[[wiara]]''.  The IE root is also the source of Latin ''[[verus|vērus]]'', German ''[[wahr]]''.

